	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quidam ex amicis necessariis, quem belle nosti, ad me IIII. die Iunii <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>scripsit, <persName ref="p18538">Caesarem</persName> certo mansurum <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> adusque Martium anni futuri <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quadragesimi noni, formulam item religionis conservandae praelegis<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>se statibus, quae pluribus ita displiceat, ut de concordia, quam ipse quaerit, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>spes prorsus nulla sit, imo plus incendii erupturum ex illa tam inconcinna <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>farragine, quam ante unquam fuerit aut enatum sit, ut taceam, quod ea etiam <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>parte, qua sana omnia sunt et recte docentur, idolo Romano mire movent <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>stomachum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Eius libri capita valde diligenter observata misit ad me, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>quae et tu ut legas tuique intelligant, percupio.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Coryphaeum egit in tota <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>illa fabula, ut audio, suffraganeus quidam <persName ref="p5190">Maguntinensis</persName>,<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Weihbischof <persName ref="p5190">Michael Helding</persName>(?).</note> cuius aliquo<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>t sermones <placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName> habitos excusos circumferri aiunt, quos ego nondum vidi.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Coemit nonnullos Antronius noster suisque, ut legant, concessit; sunt enim ver<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>nacula lingua aediti.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Quales autem sint, vel hinc intelligo, quod placent <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Antronio.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Lactucae nimirum id genus asininis labris aptissime etc. <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>misit item propositiones duas, quarum alteram Caesar, alteram <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> frater <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>statibus, congiarii arbitror loco, et in ipso comitiorum fine praelegi curavit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>non satis est, tot opes ereptas Germanię cum ingenti agmine multarum calami<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>tatum importato, nisi, quod reliquum est, omne robur et nervi omnes cum sangui<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ne horum gulae pateant, tam speciosis et honestis titulis postulata quid<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>em blande, sed mox immani extorquenda tyrannide.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Et videre aut <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>certe subodorari velim, quorsum spectent istae technę et annon foederis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>alicuius occulti satis aperti sint indices?</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Peream misere, si non ingens <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>aliquis et longe venenatissimus scorpio sub isto lapide iacet, Caesareae <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>praesertim propositionis, quam utinam penitus inspicerent pagi omnes <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Helvetici!</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Nam ista vel sola caussa te illis carere nolui.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Mein guͦter fründt schreybt mir under anderem also: "Die von <placeName ref="l257">Costentz</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>sind auch hie; khan noch nit erfaren, daß sy mit ir M[ajestä]t vertragen seygind.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Fürwar mich beduͦnkt, solt die kays.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Mt. die statt zuͦ seinem willen bekhomen, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>eß wurde größlich wider die aydgnossen sein.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Ob man inen schon guͦte <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>wort hibt, so sorg ich doch, daß hertz sey nit guͦt."</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Haec ille, qui haec adie<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>cit: "Ir weert one zweyfel wol vernomen haben, wie der papst und könig von <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Frankreych ain pündtnuß mit ainandern gemacht habend wider den <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>kayser; doch allain zuͦ deffendieren etc.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Sol ain ieder 7 tonnen golds also <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>bar zuͦsammen legen auf allen infall, und mögend noch ouch ander potentat<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>en darzuͦ khomen.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Was darauß volgen, wirt die zeyt zuͦ erkennen <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>geben."</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Haec ipse ad me satis libere et praeter morem aperte.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Quae <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>te multis de caussis caelare nolui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z13"/>Man vermaint ouch, man sölte guͦt aufsechen haben zuͦ den plätzen, so <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>der <persName ref="p7852">bischoff von Costentz</persName> an dem <placeName ref="l2459">Rhein</placeName> und <placeName ref="l2528">Bodensee</placeName> innhat etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Tu valebis cum tuis meisque omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Scripsi haec valde festinanter, <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>quo abeuntem hinc tabellionem nostratem [oder: vestratem] non morarer.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l473">San<lb xml:id="p2z17"/>galli</placeName>, X. die Iunii, anno MDXLVIII.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8049">Ioachimus Vadianus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Domino <persName ref="p495">Henrycho Bullingero</persName>, episcopo <placeName ref="l587">Tigurino</placeName>, suo.</s>
				</p>
